        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "Concrete",
            "ref": "v-concrete"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " is one of the most common building materials in the world. However, making concrete causes a lot of pollution. That’s mainly because it uses a huge amount of sand. Sand "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "mining",
            "ref": "v-mine"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " has always been bad for the environment as it damages rivers and "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "ecosystems",
            "ref": "v-ecosystem"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "A group of Japanese scientists came up with an unusual idea to help reduce this problem. What if they could "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "replace",
            "ref": "v-replace"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " some of the sand with used "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "disposable",
            "ref": "v-disposable"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "diapers",
            "zh": "尿布"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "? The scientists set about testing out their idea in the lab. To their joy, this new kind of concrete turned out to be just as safe and strong as regular concrete. They even used it to build a small house as an experiment!"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "But the scientists quickly realized a "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "practical",
            "ref": "v-practical"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " problem. If used diapers are going to be mixed into concrete, someone will have to safely collect, clean and store them first. Will this "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "complex",
            "ref": "v-complex"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " process work "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "in the long run",
            "ref": "v-in-the-long-run"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "? Even if they could really "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "figure out",
            "ref": "v-figure-out"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " a solution, you might still be asking yourself: Would I want to live in a house made with diapers? While the idea helps reduce waste, many people may feel uncomfortable about it."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
